@startuml UC-46
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-46.md
title UC-46: Show / Hide Product
footer Feature APRD-02 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-10, BR-11
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/ProductsController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ProductService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Staff, Admin

U -> MVC : Toggle product visibility
MVC -> API : PATCH /api/admin/products/{id}/visibility { isActive }
API -> SVC : SetVisibilityAsync(id, isActive)
SVC -> DB : Find product
alt not found
  SVC --> API : NotFound
  API --> MVC : 404 Not Found
  MVC --> U : Show "Not found"
else found
  SVC -> DB : Set IsActive\nSaveChangesAsync
note right of SVC : Hidden: removed from storefront, cart lines become\nunavailable; orders unaffected (BR-10, BR-11)
  SVC --> API : OK
  API --> MVC : 204 No Content
  MVC --> U : Show updated state
end

@enduml
